# Naming and control flow

- Name methods by outcome (`CreatePage`, `GetItem`).
- Early return. Nest at most two levels.
- Nullable enabled.

```csharp
public async Task<CreatePageResponse> Handle(
    CreatePageCommand command,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)
{
    if (page.Stages.Count == 0)
        throw new InvalidInputError("Нужен хотя бы один этап");
}
